      <span>On cree {kpis.nbPersonas} profils realistes — adaptes a votre secteur et votre zone geographique</span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex gap-3">
      <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-500 text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">4</span>
      <span>Chaque profil visite votre site et donne son avis — premiere impression, parcours, decision</span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex gap-3">
      <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-500 text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">5</span>
